{"id":"oghrqxwbn1r3k55ngxjhde77j","title":"小狗波比与爱丁堡的温柔守候","originalTitle":"小乖乖","summary":"在爱丁堡的灰修士墓园，一只名叫波比的斯凯㹴犬在主人下葬后守候了十四年，每日只在正午短暂离开。这一段深情的守候被铸成青铜塑像，成为老城街角的温柔标记。楼下消失的呼唤“小乖乖”唤起了对这段故事的回忆，提醒着世间深情有的被写进故事，有的藏在日常呼唤中。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=1185605&do=blog&id=1560908"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T07:05:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:20.810Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:20.810Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":7,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}